## What it is

OXO's "Barista Brain" brewer is sold as an automatic pour-over, but it's really a very good drip machine. A "rainmaker" shower head wets the grounds, it runs a bloom cycle first, and it holds the water at 197.6–204.8°F. Everything is set with one dial.

- **Grinder / scale:** neither
- **Capacity:** up to 9 cups, into a double-walled stainless thermal carafe (no hot plate), with pause-and-pour
- **Certification:** SCA certified
- **Warranty:** 2 years

## Who it's for

Anyone who wants to stop making bad drip coffee without spending $400–600. It's the cheapest way into this list, and you can pair it with a decent burr grinder.
